                        "entry_id": "5ab935e2-a50e-323d-a03b-de6c7c146bb6",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A blow or motion that buffets."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0609a589-7722-471d-9709-4c91b53f7dfe",
                                "sense_id": "29955325-2856-3876-8545-2c6f52e3074a",
                                "text": "Though still early in the afternoon, the ceaseless buffetings of a most tempestuous wind made us feel weary […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9f80e153-5dc5-4026-87f0-084ed8a36197",
                                "sense_id": "29955325-2856-3876-8545-2c6f52e3074a",
                                "text": "He suspected it was mainly for this that he married her, to be his shield against the world’s buffetings."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0c11276a-cff3-3a24-bfbe-cd51a41b5269",
                        "entry_id": "5ab935e2-a50e-323d-a03b-de6c7c146bb6",
                        "glosses": [
                            "random, irregular motion of the plane or of one of its parts caused by turbulences in the airflow"
